      "dateOfDeath": null,
      "legitimacyStatus": "bastard",
      "notes": "Bastard daughter of a Wilfriver man and a river trader's wife. The Wilfrivers are widely suspected of smuggling, and Halla's mother was likely involved in the barge trade. Acknowledged — the Wilfrivers are not proud enough to deny their blood, only proud enough to put their name on it."
    },
    {
      "_tempId": "person_farren_dunwilson",
      "firstName": "Farren",
